@david69 
if this is still an issue: 
The apostrophe marks some left out characters: the "be" of because.
I have learnt that it is ok to use 'cause in conversation but not in written text (except you are citing direct speech). 
But nowadays cause or even shorter cos/coz can be found all over the internet, written by lazy people even too lazy to use an apostrophe.

