trans-unit.note:
@david69 
It is a file.
In this case, it's a notification that the path to the epw file was automatically obtained from the previously created object called "Sun Path".

@david69 

Yes, epw refers to the epw file.

Since sky domes are objects created in FreeCAD, it is better to name them with capital letters: Sky Domes.

@david69 

Yes, simply Sun Path animation off is ok.

But since Sun Path is the name of a workbench object, it's better to start with capital letters.
